  "code_findings": [
    "City domain scripts use supervised cross entropy plus Local POD and logits; no pseudo-label pipeline enabled",
    "City loader combines official train and val then re-splits selected domains 80/20 with seed 1; cumulative evaluation re-split can overlap prior training and requires actual file-list verification",
    "City scripts use 50 epochs and differ from CIL presets in distillation factors; generic method=PLOP overrides parameters with CIL settings",
    "Paper squared L2 versus code Frobenius norm; entropy threshold clamp direction and spatial embedding dimensions require implementation-aware interpretation"
  ],
